;; Session fixture (docs/incremental.md B0), segment 1: a struct relation
;; (interned ids must stay stable across the version copy), a scalar
;; min-lattice (payload maps must copy through the boundary), and plain
;; tables.  seg2b.slog runs atop this in one live session; combined2.slog
;; is the from-scratch oracle of the union.

struct (pair int int)
lattice (cost (min int #:floor 0))
table (in int int)
table (out pair)
table (edge int int int)
table (dist int int cost)

rule (in 1 2) (in 3 4)
rule (edge 1 2 10) (edge 2 3 5)

rule (in X Y) --> (out (pair X Y))
rule (edge X Y W) --> (dist X Y W)
rule (dist X Y D) (edge Y Z W) --> (dist X Z (+ D W))
